  "body": "Urgent Action required: Vendor says bring an offer. This could be ' the best ' buy in Glendowie\r\n A highly motivated vendor and a great price present an opportunity not to be missed....\r\nThis like-new, 3-year-old home ticks all the boxes\r\n It was built by respected local builders Principle Homes, whose hallmark is high standards and attention to detail. It has low maintenance grounds featuring artificial turf and a\r\nprivate sunny courtyard.\r\n\r\nThe open plan living area features a high stud ceiling, ample natural light, solid oak wooden floors, a well designed chef’s kitchen with Bosch appliances, all separated from the entrance by a cavity door. There is a downstairs powder room plus ample storage under the stairs with a light and power point. The laundry with a good workbench and cupboards is in the garage.\r\n\r\nUpstairs there are four double bedrooms. The very spacious master has a large ensuite and fitted walk-in wardrobe. Both bathrooms are fully tiled with extractor fans, demister mirrors, underfloor heating and sensor lights.\r\n\r\nThe property has solar tiles on the roof and all surplus power is fed back into the grid. It boasts extras such as fully ducted heating and cooling, digital entry lock with Bluetooth access (which can be activated remotely). Double garage plus ample off street parking\r\n\r\nIf you have been looking for that home with the ‘X’ factor put this one on your must view list today.\r\n\r\nAll salespeople are welcome to introduce their buyers for a generous commission split\r\n\r\nOpen Home: Sunday 1.30. to 2pm or by appointment\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
